-- title:
--   Normal closure of the Mennicke generator is all of SL₂(ℤ[1/q])
-- statement:
--   Let $q$ be a natural number, assumed nonzero. Write $\mathrm{ZAway}\ q$ for the localisation `Localization.Away ((q : ℤ))` of $\mathbb{Z}$ at the element $q$, i.e. the ring $\mathbb{Z}[1/q]$, and consider the special linear group $\mathrm{SL}(2, \mathbb{Z}[1/q])$ of $2\times 2$ matrices of determinant $1$ over it. Let [`Ihara.mennickeA`](def/IharaMennickeCarrier.html#L14) be the element of $\mathrm{SL}(2,\mathbb{Z})$ given by the matrix $\begin{pmatrix}1&0\\1&1\end{pmatrix}$ (determinant $1$ by the formula for the determinant of a $2\times 2$ matrix), and let [`Ihara.slToAway q`](def/IharaAmalgamMap.html#L12) be the group homomorphism $\mathrm{SL}(2,\mathbb{Z}) \to \mathrm{SL}(2,\mathbb{Z}[1/q])$ obtained by applying the structure map $\mathbb{Z} \to \mathbb{Z}[1/q]$ entrywise. The assertion is that the normal closure, in $\mathrm{SL}(2,\mathbb{Z}[1/q])$, of the one-element subset consisting of the image of [`Ihara.mennickeA`](def/IharaMennickeCarrier.html#L14) under [`Ihara.slToAway q`](def/IharaAmalgamMap.html#L12) is the whole group, i.e. the smallest normal subgroup containing the lower elementary matrix $\begin{pmatrix}1&0\\1&1\end{pmatrix}$ is $\top$.
--
--   This is the level-one case of Mennicke's normal-closure argument: $\mathrm{SL}_2(\mathbb{Z}[1/q])$ is generated by elementary unipotents, and each of these lies in the normal subgroup generated by the single lower elementary matrix. It is used in the congruence-subgroup statements [`Ihara.mennickeCSP_of_coprime_of_stem`](thm.html#Ihara.mennickeCSP_of_coprime_of_stem), [`Ihara.mennickeCSP_of_prime`](thm.html#Ihara.mennickeCSP_of_prime) and in [`Ihara.pow_card_mem_mennickeQ_mul`](thm.html#Ihara.pow_card_mem_mennickeQ_mul).
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_Ihara_normalClosure_mennickeA_eq_top.lean

import Definitions.Def_IharaMennickeCarrier

set_option maxHeartbeats 4000000
set_option synthInstance.maxHeartbeats 400000
set_option backward.isDefEq.respectTransparency.types false

open scoped MatrixGroups

theorem Ihara.normalClosure_mennickeA_eq_top (q : ℕ) [NeZero q] :
    Subgroup.normalClosure
        ({Ihara.slToAway q Ihara.mennickeA} : Set SL(2, Ihara.ZAway q)) = ⊤ := by sorry
